# Local history of the TXR:ITC PC port. Tracked: hand-written code, configs, scripts, notes. NOT tracked: game data, anything generated
# or downloaded, build output, caches, logs and dumps (see AGENTS.md for how to regenerate each of them).

# --- Third-party code and tools (own git clones / downloads; local XenonRecomp changes are kept as patches/xenonrecomp-local.patch) ---
/tools/
/reference/
/work/deps/
/work/ffmpeg/

# --- Game data (never commit: it comes from the user's own ISO) ---
/recomp/
/work/extracted/
/work/image.bin
*.xex
*.iso
*.xwb
*.xsb
*.xma2

# --- Generated code and build output ---
/work/out/
/work/rt_build/
/work/bin/
/build/
/runtime/
/src/
*.exe
*.dll
*.obj
*.o
*.a
__pycache__/

# --- Caches (rebuilt on demand) ---
/work/shader_cache*/
/work/shaders/
*.spv
vk_pipeline_cache.bin*

# --- Test output: logs, dumps, captures ---
/work/dumps/
/work/rdoc/
*.err
*.out
*.log
*.wav
*.png
*.rdc
*.sym
*.black.txt
*.pkt.txt
/work/dll_nm.txt
/work/w1sum.txt

# --- Backups made before scripted rewrites ---
*.bak*
*.stale_*
*.tmp
